* =====================================================================
* dist_distplus : Distortion block, based on GGG MXR Distortion Plus
* Reference: GGG schematic (2012Jan27) + DIST2 parts layout (2020Feb10)
*   Designators follow the SCHEMATIC (the layout numbers some parts
*   differently, e.g. 4k7 is R6 here but R4 on the layout).
* Excluded: bypass switching (Sw1), LED indicator (D4, R11), layout D8/C8.
* Ports: in out vcc gnd
* =====================================================================
.subckt dist_distplus in out vcc gnd

* --- Bias reference Vr = Vcc/2 (high-impedance divider) ------------
R2   vcc vr   1Meg
R3   vr  gnd  1Meg
C1   vr  gnd  1u

* --- Input -----------------------------------------------------------
R1   in  gnd  1.5Meg
C3   in  gnd  1n
C2   in  n1   10n
R5   n1  p    10k
R4   p   vr   1Meg

* --- Non-inverting gain stage (IC1) ---------------------------------
X1   p m vcc gnd o {{ opamp_model }}
R8   o   m    1Meg
C5   o   m    10p
C4   m   n2   {{ C4 }}
R6   n2  n3   4.7k
R7   n3  gnd  {{ R7 }}           ; Gain (500k reverse log, rheostat)

* --- Hard clipping to ground ----------------------------------------
C6   o   n4   1u
R9   n4  c    10k
{%- if D_clip == "si" %}
D1   c   gnd  {{ diode_si_model }}
D2   gnd c    {{ diode_si_model }}
{%- elif D_clip == "ge" %}
D1   c   gnd  {{ diode_ge_model }}
D2   gnd c    {{ diode_ge_model }}
{%- elif D_clip == "led" %}
D1   c   gnd  {{ diode_led_model }}
D2   gnd c    {{ diode_led_model }}
{%- endif %}
C7   c   gnd  {{ C7 }}

* --- Level (output taken directly from the wiper, no buffer) -------
R10A out gnd  {{ R10A }}         ; Level (100k log), wiper to ground
R10B c   out  {{ R10B }}         ; Level (100k log), top to wiper

.ends dist_distplus
